   893	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   894	// Phase 6.4-3d Step 5 (2026-05-29) -- CellDiagnostic -> cell tooltip.
   895	//
   896	// `Event::CellDiagnostic` (the UDF no-worker/raised/timeout/died sink) arrives
