   311	    /// no-worker) `=MYUDF(..)`; the same helpers DRAIN it into
   312	    /// `Event::CellDiagnostic` after the runtime borrow ends. Always-present
   313	    /// (cheap empty `Vec`), unlike `udf_worker`. `!Sync` `RefCell` is sound
