   940		/**
   941		 * V3.2.c.3: tick of the pollRemote loop.  Called every
   942		 * POLL_REMOTE_INTERVAL_MS by the setInterval timer.
   943		 *
   944		 * - If a reconnect is in flight: skip (cheap idempotency).
   945		 * - Try `session.pollRemote()`; if `n > 0`, re-render the panel
   946		 *   so freshly-merged remote ops surface in the grid.
   947		 * - On `transport_closed` from pollRemote or its observation
   948		 *   path: trigger {@link handleTransportClosed} (reconnect with
   949		 *   backoff per decision C6).
   950		 * - On any other error: log + skip the tick.  Pollloop survives
   951		 *   one bad tick.
